---
source: crates/ym-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"looks\", \"bake\"])"
---
Developer tool: bake a parametric look to a 33-point LUT and render a contact sheet

Usage: ym looks bake [OPTIONS] <LOOK_JSON>

Arguments:
  <LOOK_JSON>  The parametric look file to bake (for example `signature.json`)

Options:
      --preview <ARW>...  ARW files to render into a contact sheet: each row shows Neutral on the left and the baked look on the right
  -q, --quiet             Print only errors on stderr
      --out <DIR>         Folder for the `.cube` file and the contact sheet (default: the look file's folder)
  -v, --verbose           Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
  -h, --help              Print help
